  "details": "VRChat's team have never been about community first. \n\nYou ignore your community CONSTANTLY, and it was made evident specially during the mod-ban times, when not only you ignored the community hating the EAC addition, but blackmailed many mod devs. We remember it.\n\nThere has been dozens of issues reported and thousands of users who begged them to get fixed/changed and we are often ignored in favor of useless things some random intern wants(like the recent UI change).\n\nSo remove that stupid phrase. It literally spits in the face of every player whos been around for more than a year. \n\nIf you want to be community first ACT LIKE IT instead of saying it.",
